 # FinMark Prototype
 
-This repository contains a functional prototype of a user login module for the FinMark project, developed as part of Milestone 2. It demonstrates a clean architecture with a Python FastAPI backend and a simple HTML/CSS/JavaScript frontend.
+This repository contains a functional prototype of a user authentication module for the FinMark project. It uses a Python FastAPI backend with a simple HTML/CSS/JavaScript frontend.
+
+## Implemented Features
+
+- User registration endpoint: `POST /api/v1/auth/register`
+- Login endpoint: `POST /api/v1/auth/token`
+- Password hashing with `passlib[bcrypt]`
+- Signed JWT access tokens using `python-jose`
+- Protected data route with bearer-token validation
+- Frontend login form with token storage and dashboard redirect
+- Frontend registration form
+- Dashboard logout button that removes `access_token`
+- `.env` support for secrets and runtime configuration
 
